theorem k215UnpairAt1015CycleZero (b n c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt1015State k215PNum1015 0 b (suc n) c) (k215UnpairAt1015State k215PNum1015 (suc b) 0 n c) $ = '(ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1015Reach9S) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1015Reach10) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1015Reach11Z) (ax_mp (ax_mp k215PReach_trans k215UnpairAt1015ReachTransfer) k215UnpairAt1015Reach16))));
