pub theorem k215UnpairMacro1015 (n a b c: nat): $ k215PReach (k215UnpairAt1015State k215PNum1015 a b n c) (k215UnpairAt1015State k215PNum1023 (fst ((a, b) + n)) (snd ((a, b) + n)) 0 c) $ =
